## Summary
Soongsil University's G-LAMP project group has signed a Memorandum of Understanding with Cedars-Sinai Medical Center for collaboration in AI and bio convergence research. This partnership aims to advance medical research and technology through interdisciplinary cooperation.

## Key Points
- MOU signed between Soongsil University G-LAMP and Cedars-Sinai Medical Center.
- Focus on AI and bio convergence research.
- Collaboration intended to enhance medical innovation and research capabilities.
- International partnership bridging Korean academia and US medical center.


